    "description": "DA Services Crop Sown routes. Always sign in with POST /api/v1/da-services/sso/login (username, password, key). Stores access_token and csrf_token. Every later request sends Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}} and X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf_token}} (forwarded to Crop Sown staff). On 401, re-run SSO Login. Read regions stores region_level_value_id. Save farmer lookup stores submission_id. Guide: docs/crop-sown-integration.md.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
