        "description": "Crop Sown identity, season, location, and planning. The live body lists every register field. Catalog choices are value_id plus value_display. This saved example keeps one field from each of the first two sections. CROP_SEASON has three live values. CROP_COMMODITY and SEED_VARIETY continue on later pages. Query form is required; response is that form only."
      },
